        {
         "id": "51004d5c",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>Since 2009, Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling has kept Central Iowa homes warm and comfortable through the harshest Midwest winters. Whether your furnace breaks down on a freezing night, your home heater needs a seasonal safety check, or you’re ready for an energy-efficient furnace replacement, our certified technicians are on call 24/7 across Des Moines, Urbandale, Waukee, West Des Moines, and surrounding communities.</p>",
