          },
          {
           "id": "51024432",
           "settings": {
            "title": "Emergency Heating &amp; Furnace Repair ",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "51025789",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Is your furnace blowing cold air, making strange noises, or refusing to turn on? Our expert technicians rapidly diagnose and fix heating failures, broken thermostats, ignition issues, and faulty blower motors on all makes and models of gas furnaces, electric heaters, and heat pumps.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "51026ae0",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/heating-repair/\">Explore Heating &amp; Furnace Repair Services <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "5102deea",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5102918e",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-heat\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5102a4e5",
           "settings": {
            "title": "Furnace &amp; Heater Replacement ",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5102b83c",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>When an aging, inefficient furnace becomes too expensive to keep repairing, a new high-efficiency heating system can drastically lower your monthly utility bills. We provide tailored furnace replacements and complete heating system installations backed by manufacturer warranties and flexible financing options.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5102cb93",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/heating-replacement/\">Learn More About Furnace Replacement <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "51033f9d",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5102f241",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-flame\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "51030598",
           "settings": {
            "title": "New Heating Installation ",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "510318ef",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Building a new home, remodeling, or adding supplementary heat to a room? We design and install custom furnace and heater setups designed specifically for your home's square footage and airflow requirements, ensuring quiet, balanced warmth in every room.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "51032c46",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/heating-installation/\">Discover Heating Installation Solutions <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
